uth, Justice and the American way?  Well, he can take his usual seat at the back of the bus.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8600261393668075780/comments/default/5778279746688060779'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8600261393668075780/comments/default/5778279746688060779'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/02/this-is-man-defiance-of-omar-deghayes.html?showComment=1265208936223#c5778279746688060779' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/02/this-is-man-defiance-of-omar-deghayes.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8600261393668075780' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8600261393668075780' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 3, 2010 at 7:55 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5248868985039242446</id><published>2010-02-03T04:47:07.632-07:00</published><updated>2010-02-03T04:47:07.632-07:00</updated><title type='text'>WHY ISN&amp;#39;T THIS ON EVERY TELEVISON STATION IN T...</title><content type='html'>WHY ISN&amp;#39;T THIS ON EVERY TELEVISON STATION IN THE COUNTRY?  WHEN WILL THE AMERICAN PUBLIC RISE UP AND END THIS HORROR?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8600261393668075780/comments/default/5248868985039242446'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='ht