ayes.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8600261393668075780' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8600261393668075780' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1465855590"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 2, 2010 at 5:33 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7813471549862421612</id><published>2010-02-02T15:51:24.858-07:00</published><updated>2010-02-02T15:51:24.858-07:00</updated><title type='text'>This is an amazing story that I didn&amp;#39;t know --...</title><content type='html'>This is an amazing story that I didn&amp;#39;t know -- not something one is going to read about in CIA-administered organs such as the WaPo and the NYT.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Thank you.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8600261393668075780/comments/default/7813471549862421612'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/8600261393668075780/comments/default/7813471549862421612'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/02/this-is-man-defiance-of-omar-deghayes.html?showComment=1265151084858#c7813471549862421612' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/02/this-is-man-defiance-of-omar-deghayes.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8600261393668075780' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/8600261393668075780' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-512796454"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 2, 2010 at 3:51 PM"/></entry><entry>